`The following fees apply [Ticketing will charge service fee, please see the rules from tixcraft website.] All applicable fees will be shown at checkout. VIP 套票 Package The Last Forever Fan Experience GA站區門票一張One general admission ticket 優先入場（首批進場）First access into the venue (1st tier) LANY獨家暖身演出Access to an Intimate preshow performance by LANY Jake and Paul 獨家問答環節Exclusive Trivia + Q&A session with Jake and Paul 10人一組與LANY於台前合照Group photograph in front of the stage with LANY (Group of 10) LANY簽名專屬VIP周邊Autographed LANY VIP merchandise package 專屬VIP掛牌及掛繩一套Commemorative VIP laminate & lanyard 周邊商品優先購買(限演出現場有販售時) Priority merchandise shopping (if applicable) The Soft VIP Package GA站區門票一張One general admission ticket 優先入場（第二批進場）Early entry into the venue (2nd tier) 專屬VIP周邊LANY VIP merchandise package 專屬VIP掛牌及掛繩一套Commemorative VIP laminate & lanyard 周邊商品優先購買(限演出現場有販售時) Priority merchandise shopping (if applicable) SPONSORED BY：星展萬事達卡DBS Mastercard，台灣大哥大，MyVideo ※ 實際時間請以現場公告為準。 ※ 站區請依票面序號整隊和排隊入場，如未能於公布的整隊時間內報到整隊，將視同放棄您的序號優先權利，需按照現場工作人員指示依現場隊伍順序入場。 ※ VIP活動及周邊限於演出當日的指定時間內，憑同場VIP票券參加及領取，逾時將視同自行放棄權利，且不予退票。 ※ VIP 福利活動報到時間不等於演出時間，請務必於演出日前至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台詳讀活動入場時間及相關流程，以免損害權益。如未能於公布的時間內報到，將視同放棄您的權利。 ※ 為了人身安全起見，孕婦及身高未滿110公分或未滿7歲孩童，請勿購買站區票券，主辦方將有權謝絕入場。 ※ 座位區請對號入座。110公分以下兒童不得進入3樓。2、3樓觀眾勿站立跺腳，以拍手取代跳動。 ※ 購買前請注意，本節目每張票券外加系統服務費200元。 ※ 本場於演出日前5日開放取票，於ibon取票時無須支付取票手續費。 ※ 請務必於演出日前至至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台，詳讀確認演唱會入場時間流程及相關規範，以免損害自身權益。 NOTICE －For Seated ticket holders, please be seated in your allocated seat. －Actual show time is subject to on-site conditions. －Tickets can be collected 5 days before the show. －Please note before purchasing, there will be an additional NT$200 system service fee for each ticket. －Please line up and enter according to the ticket serial number. If you fail to check in on time will be result in forfeited your ticket number, and must follow the staff instructions to enter. －The show time printed on the ticket does not indicate VIP check-in or door time. Please check VIP event details via the official Live Nation Taiwan’s website and social media platforms for entry notice. VIP benefits are only available during the designated time on the show day. Late check-in will result in forfeiture of VIP privileges, and no refunds will be issued. －For safety reasons, pregnant individuals and children under 110 cm or under 7 years of age are advised not to purchase standing area tickets. The organizer reserves the right to refuse entry. －For Seated ticket holders, please be seated in your allocated seat. Children under 110 cm are not allowed on 3F. No standing or stomping on 2F & 3F. Please clap instead of jumping. －Please be sure to visit Live Nation Taiwan official website and socials for door time and entry notice before show day. SPONSORED BY：DBS Mastercard, Taiwan Mobile, MyVideo 售票相關資訊Ticketing Information 星展萬事達卡卡友預售票 (僅限星展萬事達卡信用卡與簽帳金融卡付款) DBS Mastercard Presale (Only paid by DBS Mastercard credit card and debit card) 時間TIME：2026/03/25 (三WED) 10:00 ~ 2026/03/26 (四THU) 10:00 * 更多訊息請至 priceless.com/DBS-TW 瞭解更多。 * 星展萬事達卡卡友驗證：在驗證頁面，若您持有的是信用卡，請輸入卡號前6碼，簽帳金融卡請輸入前8碼。 * 單筆訂單限購4張，可支援行動裝置購票。 * 數量有限，售完為止 * These Tickets are available exclusively to DBS Mastercard cardholders and can only be purchased using a DBS Mastercard and by paying through the Mastercard network. * DBS Mastercard Cardholder Verification: On the verification page, if you hold a credit card, please enter the first 6 digits. If you hold a debit card, please enter the first 8 digits. * For more priceless experiences: www.priceless.com/DBS-TW * Please note that you may purchase up to 4 tickets per order. * Ticket quantities are limited and available until sold out. 星展萬事達卡飛行世界之極卡和飛行世界商務卡卡友精選票 DBS Travel World Elite/ World Business Mastercard Preferred Tickets 時間：2026/03/27 (五 FRI) 12:00 * 更多訊息請至 priceless.com/DBS-TW 瞭解更多。 * 星展萬事達卡飛行世界之極卡和飛行世界商務卡卡友驗證：在驗證頁面，請輸入指定星展萬事達卡世界卡信用卡卡號前8碼。 * 單筆訂單限購4張，可支援行動裝置購票。 * 數量有限，售完為止 * These Tickets are available exclusively to 