INSERT INTO "concert_crawl_candidate" ("id","source","source_id","source_kind","title","url","event_at","venue","city","organizer","extracted_text","raw_excerpt","status","confidence","ai_summary","error_message","crawled_at","reviewed_at","created_at","updated_at","evidence_json","source_payload_json","content_hash","parser_version") VALUES(322,'tixcraft','26_kodaline_c','ticket_platform','【Mastercard專區】Kodaline - Farewell Tour','https://tixcraft.com/activity/detail/26_kodaline_c','2026-08-23T16:00:00.000Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,'請慎防詐騙，切勿相信來路不明的客服通知 TW 中文 地區 國家 Taiwan Australia Belgium Brasil Canada Česká republika Chile Cyprus Danmark Deutschland España France Ireland Israel Italia México Nederland New Zealand Norge Österreich Peru Philippines Polska Singapore South Africa Suomi Sverige Switzerland Thailand Türkiye United Arab Emirates United Kingdom United States Ελλάδα 語言 中文 English 日本語 中文 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 功能選單 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 首頁 節目資訊 【Mastercard專區】Kodaline - Farewell Tour 【Mastercard專區】Kodaline - Farewell Tour 購票流程 Purchasing Procedure 退票申請表單 Refund Application Form 欲購票者，需先完成加入會員及手機號碼驗證，驗證成功後才可開始購票，請提早完成手機驗證，以免影響購票。（手機號碼僅限首次加入會員者需要驗證。） --- Please note, if you are a new fan you will only be able to start purchasing tickets after successfully verifying your mobile phone number. We suggest that you verify your mobile number in advance to speed up your ticket purchases. 節目介紹 注意事項 購票提醒 取票提醒 退票說明 Kodaline – Farewell Tour Kodaline最後告別！ 愛爾蘭療癒樂團 Kodaline 十三年經典濃縮一夜 把那些沒說完的情緒再唱一遍 從虐心代表作 〈All I Want〉 到惹哭全球的破碎情歌〈High Hopes〉 8月24 TICC 畫下美麗句點 Irish indie rock band Kodaline is bringing their farewell tour to Taipei on Aug 24 at TICC, marking a special night that encapsulates highlights from their 13-year career. Set your reminders and get your tickets on time! Kodaline – Farewell Tour ● 時間：2026/08/24 (一) 20:00 ● 地點：台北國際會議中心(TICC) ● 票價：NTD.2,300元起至9,700元 ＆身障優惠票 (陪同票) NTD.1950元，實際票價以當下顯示為準，票價可能會因依座位區域及票券供應狀況調整，數量有限，售完為止。所有適用費用將於結帳頁面顯示。 ● TIME：2026/08/24 (MON) 20:00 ● VENUE：TAIPEI INTERNATIONAL CONVENTION CENTER (TICC) ● PRICE：Ticket prices range from NTD 2,300 to 9,700. Price range is subject to change based on availability and may vary by section. Limited quantities may be available at each price point. `The following fees apply [Ticketing will charge service fee, please see the rules from tixcraft website. All applicable fees will be shown at checkout. SOUNDCHECK VIP PACKAGE - NTD 9,700 包含： 前區座位票券x1 One seated ticket 專享參與演前部份soundcheck Enjoy exclusive access to watch part of the pre-show Kodaline soundcheck 專屬VIP 吊繩及掛牌x1組 Official VIP laminate and lanyard VIP專屬小禮 Exclusive VIP Kodaline gift item 周邊商品優先購買(限演出現場有販售時) Priority merchandise shopping (if applicable) ※ 實際時間請以現場公告為準 ※ 全座位，請對號入座。 ※ 購買前請注意，本節目每張票券外加系統服務費200元。 ※ 本場演出於演出前5日始開放取票。 ※ VIP活動及周邊限於演出當日的指定時間內，憑同場VIP票券參加及領取，逾時將視同自行放棄權利，且不予退票。 ※ VIP 福利活動報到時間不等於演出時間，請務必於演出日前至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台詳讀活動入場時間及相關流程，以免損害權益。如未能於公布的時間內報到，將視同放棄您的權利。 ※ 請務必於演出日前至至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台，詳讀確認演唱會入場時間流程及相關規範，以免損害自身權益。 * Actual show time is subject to on-site conditions. * All seated, please be seated in your assigned seat. * Please note before purchasing - there will be an additional NT$200 system service fee for each ticket. * Tickets available for collection 5 days prior to the show. * The show time printed on the ticket does not indicate VIP check-in or door time. Please check VIP event details via the official Live Nation Taiwan’s website and social media platforms for entry notice. VIP benefits are only available during the designated time on the show day. Late check-in will result in forfeiture of VIP privileges, and no refunds will be issued. *Please be sure to visit Live Nation Taiwan official website and socials for door time and entry notice before show day. Official Partner： 星展萬事達卡DBS Mastercard 售票相關資訊Ticketing Information ● 星展萬事達卡卡友預售票(僅限星展萬事達卡信用卡與簽帳金融卡付款) TIME: 2026/03/31 (TUE) 11:00 ~ 23:59 更多訊息請至 priceless.com/DBS-TW 瞭解更多。 星展萬事達卡卡友驗證：在驗證頁面，若您持有的是信用卡，請輸入卡號前6碼，簽帳金融卡請輸入前8碼。 單筆訂單限購4張，可支援行動裝置購票。 數量有限，售完為止。 ● DBS Mastercard Presale(Only paid by DBS Mastercard credit card and debit card) 開賣時間：2026/03/31 (二) 11:00 ~ 23:59 For more priceless experiences: www.priceless.com/DBS-TW DBS Mastercard Cardholder Verification: On the verification page, if you hold a credit card, please enter the first 6 digits. If you hold a debit card, please enter the first 8 digits. Please note that you may purchase up to 4 tickets per order. Ticket quantities are limited and available until sold out. ＊本網站所提供之演唱會門票為星展萬事達卡卡友專享，並會視情況進行調整或修改。 ＊These Tickets are available exclusively to DBS Mastercard cardholders and can only be purchased using a DBS Mastercard and by paying through the Mastercard network. *拓元會員註冊：https://help.tixcraft.com/hc/zh-tw Register on tixcraft : http://tixcraft.com/faq *更多節目及活動資訊: www.livenation.com.tw More Event Info: www.livenation.com.tw 須知 📍入場須配合安檢及入場須知 為安全考量，禁止攜帶行李箱及超過 37 x 25 x 11.5公分之包包；會場內全面禁止攜帶外食和飲料(水除外)、除手機之外，任何形式之拍照、攝影、錄音等設備(包含如手機擴充鏡頭、增距鏡、腳架、手持棒、穩定器、自拍棒等等) 皆禁止攜帶及使用，並嚴禁任何形式之直播。主辦單位有權請違反規定者立即離開現場，會場未設置置物櫃，建議輕便前往，並請提早到場進行安檢以避免耽誤觀賞演出。相關規定請於演出日前造訪LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站、官方臉書粉絲專頁、Instagram、Ｘ 獲得最新資訊。主辦單位保留修改或終止本活動之權力。 📍 There will be Security Check upon entry. No trunk, no bag size over 37 x 25 x 11.5cm, no food and beverage (except water) . Except for mobile phones, all forms of photography, videography, and audio recording devices (including phone lenses, tripods, stabilizer, selfie sticks, etc.) are strictly prohibited from being brought in or used. Any form of live streaming is also strictly forbidden. There is no lockers at the venue. The promoter has the right to deny entry if you violate regulations and can ask you to seek elsewhere to store items that aren’t allowed entry. Please arrive in advance for security check to avoid late entry. There is no coin locker at the venue. For more entry regulations, please check the LIVE NATION TAIWAN website、facebook、Instagram、Ｘ for the latest updates. ⚠️ 以上活動內容，主辦單位保留異動之權力。 ⚠️ 本公司為尊重他人音樂著作財產權，秉持事先授權原則，承諾於所舉辦之演唱會演出前向權利人申請合法授權。 ⚠️ 本場演出所使用音樂將向MÜST取得授權。 📍 The promoter reserves the right to change these terms & conditions at any time. ※本平台所售出之活動，除非特別標示，皆無提供履約保障機制。 ※購買票券前，請先了解並同意以上規範，如不同意請勿購買，以免產生不必要之糾紛及損害；當進行購票及退票作業時，將視同您已瞭解並同意遵守以上全部事項。 以下為外部廣告網站，與本公司無關，請審慎點擊廣告連結 以上為外部廣告網站，與本公司無關，請審慎點擊廣告連結 客戶服務及消費爭議處理 票務服務單位：拓元股份有限公司／統一編號54651107 客服專線：+886 (02) 8772-9835 客服信箱：聯繫我們 客服時間：週一 ~ 週五 10:00-12:30 | 13:30-18:00 (適逢國定假日暫停服務) 相關連結 關於拓元 會員服務條款 隱私權政策 Cookie 偏好設定 © tixCraft, a company of Ticketmaster group. All rights reserved. 當您按下"接受所有 Cookie"，表示您同意我們使用 Cookie 的方式。我們使用 Cookie 以提昇本系統的服務品質、提供個人化內容和廣告、分析使用狀況以協助我們進行行銷工作。 接受所有 Cookie 全部拒絕 Cookie 設定','請慎防詐騙，切勿相信來路不明的客服通知 TW 中文 地區 國家 Taiwan Australia Belgium Brasil Canada Česká republika Chile Cyprus Danmark Deutschland España France Ireland Israel Italia México Nederland New Zealand Norge Österreich Peru Philippines Polska Singapore South Africa Suomi Sverige Switzerland Thailand Türkiye United Arab Emirates United Kingdom United States Ελλάδα 語言 中文 English 日本語 中文 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 功能選單 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 首頁 節目資訊 【Mastercard專區】Kodaline - Farewell Tour 【Mastercard專區】Kodaline - Farewell Tour 購票流程 Purchasing Procedure 退票申請表單 Refund Application Form 欲購票者，需先完成加入會員及手機號碼驗證，驗證成功後才可開始購票，請提早完成手機驗證，以免影響購票。（手機號碼僅限首次加入會員者需要驗證。） --- Please note, if you are a new fan you will only be able to start purchasing tickets after successfully verifying your mobile phone number. We suggest that you verify your mobile number in advance to speed up your ticket purchases. 節目介紹 注意事項 購票提醒 取票提醒 退票說明 Kodaline – Farewell Tour Kodaline最後告別！ 愛爾蘭療癒樂團 Kodaline 十三年經典濃縮一夜 把那些沒說完的情緒再唱一遍 從虐心代表作 〈All I Want〉 到惹哭全球的破碎情歌〈High Hopes〉 8月24 TICC 畫下美麗句點 Irish indie rock band Kodaline is bringing their farewell tour to Taipei on Aug 24 at TICC, marking a special night that encapsulates highlights from their 13-year career. Set your reminders and get your tickets on time! Kodaline – Farewell Tour ● 時間：2026/08/24 (一) 20:00 ● 地點：台北國際會議中心(TICC) ● 票價：NTD.2,300元起至9