INSERT INTO "concert_crawl_candidate" ("id","source","source_id","source_kind","title","url","event_at","venue","city","organizer","extracted_text","raw_excerpt","status","confidence","ai_summary","error_message","crawled_at","reviewed_at","created_at","updated_at","evidence_json","source_payload_json","content_hash","parser_version") VALUES(359,'tixcraft','26_itzy_c','ticket_platform','【Mastercard專區】ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR ＜TUNNEL VISION＞ in KAOHSIUNG','https://tixcraft.com/activity/detail/26_itzy_c','2026-06-26T16:00:00.000Z',NULL,NULL,NULL,'請慎防詐騙，切勿相信來路不明的客服通知 TW 中文 地區 國家 Taiwan Australia Belgium Brasil Canada Česká republika Chile Cyprus Danmark Deutschland España France Ireland Israel Italia México Nederland New Zealand Norge Österreich Peru Philippines Polska Singapore South Africa Suomi Sverige Switzerland Thailand Türkiye United Arab Emirates United Kingdom United States Ελλάδα 語言 中文 English 日本語 中文 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 功能選單 節目資訊 最新消息 常見問題 訂單查詢 會員登入 首頁 節目資訊 【Mastercard專區】ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR ＜TUNNEL VISION＞ in KAOHSIUNG 【Mastercard專區】ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR ＜TUNNEL VISION＞ in KAOHSIUNG 退票申請表單 Refund Application Form 欲購票者，需先完成加入會員及手機號碼驗證，驗證成功後才可開始購票，請提早完成手機驗證，以免影響購票。（手機號碼僅限首次加入會員者需要驗證。） --- Please note, if you are a new fan you will only be able to start purchasing tickets after successfully verifying your mobile phone number. We suggest that you verify your mobile number in advance to speed up your ticket purchases. 節目介紹 注意事項 購票提醒 取票提醒 退票說明 ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR <TUNNEL VISION> in KAOHSIUNG ITZY首度南下攻蛋！ 全新巡演 霸氣登場 ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR <TUNNEL VISION> in KAOHSIUNG 6 月 27 日（六） 高雄巨蛋 霸氣開唱 The wait is over! MIDZY, get ready for ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR <TUNNEL VISION> in KAOHSIUNG on 27 Jun at Kaohsiung Arena. Set your reminders and get your tickets on time! ITZY 3RD WORLD TOUR <TUNNEL VISION> in KAOHSIUNG 時間TIME：2026/06/27 (六 Sat) 18:00 地點Venue：高雄巨蛋（K-ARENA） 票價Price：NT$ 5,880/ 4,880/ 4,380/ 3,880/ 2,880/ 非輪椅區身障優惠票(陪同票) 2,440 / 輪椅區身障優惠票(陪同票) 1,440 VIP套票：NT$ 6,880 VIP套票 VIP Package：NT$ 6,880 VIP - NT$ 6,880：包含 SOUNDCHECK PARTY、周邊商品優先購買權（限演出現場有販售時）、VIP優先入場、VIP紀念吊牌及掛繩 、VIP獨家紀念禮一份 (Includes Exclusive VIP gift (1 set), VIP laminate and lanyard, Access to the soundcheck, Priority merchandise shopping (if applicable), Early entry to the venue) －特區搖滾站區VIP，請依票面序號整隊入場 －實際時間請以現場公告為準 －本場演出於演出前5日始開放取票。 －購買前請注意，本節目每張票券外加系統服務費200元。 －VIP 福利活動報到時間不等於演出時間，請務必於演出日前至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台詳讀活動入場時間及相關流程，以免損害權益。如未能於公布的時間內報到，將視同放棄您的權利。 －請務必於演出日前至 LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站 及社群平台，詳讀確認演唱會入場時間流程及相關規範，以免損害自身權益。 －為了人身安全起見，孕婦及身高未滿110公分或未滿7歲孩童，請勿購買站區票券，主辦方將有權謝絕入場。 －高雄巨蛋周邊道路易壅塞，請多利用大眾運輸工具。 －關於視線遮蔽： 館內部分座位因場館設計，前方或側邊設有欄杆（屬相關固定安全設施）可能會對視線造成部分遮擋。若對欄杆影響視線有所顧慮，請於購票前審慎考慮，確認可接受後再行購票，現場將不接受因視線受阻或遮擋而退票或換位。 下方所列區域的座位因所處位置，可能因位置離主舞台兩側較靠近，或因舞台設計、硬體搭設角度、會場設施、安全設施、控台、硬體設備等實際進場定位後，而致部分舞台視線遮蔽，而無法看到完整主舞台及副舞台、 - 區域：紅220、橙207、橙509 NOTICE －VIP GA please line up for entry according to the ticket serial number. －Actual show time is subject to on-site conditions. －Tickets can be collected 5 days before the show. －Please note before purchasing, there will be an additional NT$200 system service fee for each ticket. －The show time printed on the ticket does not indicate VIP check-in or door time. Please check VIP event details via the official Live Nation Taiwan’s website and social media platforms for entry notice. VIP benefits are only available during the designated time on the show day. Late check-in will result in forfeiture of VIP privileges, and no refunds will be issued. －Please be sure to visit Live Nation Taiwan official website and socials for door time and entry notice before show day. －For safety reasons, pregnant individuals and children under 110 cm or under 7 years of age are advised not to purchase standing area tickets. The organizer reserves the right to refuse entry. －The roads around K-Arena are prone to heavy traffic congestion. Please make use of public transportation whenever possible. －Restricted View： There are safety railings (fixed venue facilities) in front and on the sides of the seating areas, which may partially restrict the view. If you are concerned about the railing affecting your view, please consider carefully before purchasing. No refunds or seat exchanges will be accepted on-site due to restricted views. Please be advised that certain areas listed below may have obstructed views due to the proximity to the sides of the main stage, or because of the stage design, production setup angles, venue structures, safety installations, FOH, and other hardware and equipment. This could result in a partial or limited view of the stage and performance. The degree of obstruction varies depending on the specific area. We kindly ask that you carefully consider this before purchasing. Please note before purchasing, no refunds will be accepted onsite due to restricted view. We sincerely appreciate your understanding. -Restricted View Area：Red 220, Orange 207, Orange 509 SPONSORED BY：星展萬事達卡DBS Mastercard、台灣大哥大Taiwan Mobile、MyVideo ⁠ 售票相關資訊Ticketing Information ●星展萬事達卡卡友預售票 (僅限星展萬事達卡信用卡與簽帳金融卡付款) DBS Mastercard Presale (Only paid by DBS Mastercard credit card and debit card) 時間TIME：2026/03/24 (二 Tue) 11:00 ~ 23:59 * 更多訊息請至 priceless.com/DBS-TW 瞭解更多。 * 星展萬事達卡卡友驗證：在驗證頁面，若您持有的是信用卡，請輸入卡號前6碼，簽帳金融卡請輸入前8碼。 * 單筆訂單限購4張，可支援行動裝置購票。 * 數量有限，售完為止 * These Tickets are available exclusively to DBS Mastercard cardholders and can only be purchased using a DBS Mastercard and by paying through the Mastercard network. * For more priceless experiences: www.priceless.com/DBS-TW * Please note that you may purchase up to 4 tickets per order. * Ticket quantities are limited and available until sold out. *本網站所提供之演唱會門票為星展萬事達卡卡友專享，並會視情況進行調整或修改。 *拓元會員註冊：https://help.tixcraft.com/hc/zh-tw Register on tixcraft : http://tixcraft.com/faq *更多節目及活動資訊: www.livenation.com.tw More Event Info: www.livenation.com.tw 📍演唱會現場將進行錄影/錄音/拍照，部分觀眾之影像可能被拍攝或使用於演唱會影片中，當您進入會場參加本演唱會活動時，即視同您已同意接受被拍照及攝影的可能性，主辦單位及演唱會製作方對於任何侵犯肖像權或商業利用全等提出將概不負責。 📍入場須配合安檢及入場須知 為安全考量，禁止攜帶行李箱和超過 37 x 25 x 11.5公分之包包；會場內全面禁止攜帶外食和飲料(水除外)、除手機之外，任何形式之拍照、攝影、錄音等設備(包含自拍棒、腳架等)皆禁止攜帶及使用，並嚴禁任何形式之直播。主辦單位有權請違反規定者立即離開現場，會場未設有置物櫃，建議輕便前往，並請提早到場進行安檢以避免耽誤觀賞演出。相關規定請於演出日前造訪LIVE NATION TAIWAN官方網站、官方臉書粉絲專頁、Instagram、Ｘ 獲得最新資訊。主辦單位保留修改或終止本活動之權力。 📍以上活動內容，主辦單位保留異動之權力。 📍 Please note, if you are a new fan, you will only be able to start purchasing tickets after successfully verifying your mobile phone number. We suggest that you verify your mobile number in advance to speed up your ticket purchases. 📍Video Recording and photo shoots will be taking place on site. Please acknowledge that by entering the site you hereby agree to the possible exposure to the recordings and the photo shoots and we will not be responsible for any violation of tour publicity rights. 📍 There will be Security Check upon entry. No trunk, no bag size over 37 x 25 x 11.5cm, no food and beverage (except water) . Except for mobile phones, all forms of photography, videography, and audio recording devices (including selfie sticks, tripods, etc.) are strictly prohibited from being brought in or used. Any form of live streaming is also strictly forbidden. There are limited lockers at the venue. The promoter has the right to deny entry if you violate regulations and can ask you to seek elsewhere to store items that aren’t allowed entry. Please arrive in advance for security check to avoid late entry. There is less coin locker at the venue. For more entry regulations, please check the LIVE NATION TAIWAN website、facebook、Instagram、Ｘ for the latest updates. 📍 The promoter reserves the right to change these terms & conditions at any time. ①本公司為尊重他人音樂著作財產權，秉持事先授權原則，承諾於所舉辦之演唱會演出前向權利人申請合法授權。 ②本場演出所使用音樂將向MÜST取得授權。 示意圖僅供參考示意 ※本平台所售出之活動，除非特別標示，皆無提供履約保障機制。 ※購買票券前，請先了解並同意以上規範，如不同意請勿購買，以免產生不必要之糾紛及損害；當進行購票及退票作業時，將視同您已瞭解並同意遵守以上全部事項。 以下為外部廣告網站，與本公司無關，請審慎點擊廣告連結 以上為外部廣告網站，與本公司無關，請審慎點擊廣告連結 客戶服務及消費爭議處理 票務服務單位：拓元股份有限公司／統一編號54651107 客服專線：+886 (02) 8772-9835 客服信箱：聯繫我們 客服時間：週一 ~ 週五 10:00-12:30 | 13:30-18:00 (適逢國定假日暫停服務) 相關連結 關於拓元 會員服務條款 隱私權政策 Cookie 偏好設定 © tixCra