INSERT INTO "concert_crawl_candidate" ("id","source","source_id","source_kind","title","url","event_at","venue","city","organizer","extracted_text","raw_excerpt","status","confidence","ai_summary","error_message","crawled_at","reviewed_at","created_at","updated_at","evidence_json","source_payload_json","content_hash","parser_version") VALUES(390,'opentix','opentix:event-2001506396461768705','ticket_platform','十鼓藝術季-2026魔法夜祭2 神之島','https://www.opentix.life/event/2001506396461768705','2026-07-10T16:00:00.000Z','十鼓文創園區 夢糖劇場',NULL,'主辦： 十鼓文創股份有限公司 06-2662225','首頁 藝術節及活動 旗艦館 公告 服務據點 協助中心 搜尋 OPENTIX 十鼓藝術季-2026魔法夜祭2 神之島 2026Magic Night Festival 2 類別： 音樂 分級：普遍級 時間：2026/7/11 (六) 19:30 主辦： 十鼓文創股份有限公司 06-2662225 收藏 十鼓擊樂團 魔法夜祭 十鼓文創園區 沉浸式 購票資訊節目介紹折扣方案重要須知 購票資訊 選擇場館 十鼓文創園區 夢糖劇場 場館地址：臺南市仁德區文華路二段326號 地圖 選擇場次 節目介紹 魔法夜祭2-神之島 | Magic Night Festival 2 - Island of the Gods 如果錯過了「池中劍Ⅲ~神魔之界」，或還未曾體驗過十鼓的《魔法夜祭1》，這場跨時空的「百年廢墟」限定《魔法夜祭2》專場演出將成為您不容錯過的經典之作！ If you missed "Sword in the Pool III ~ Realm of Gods and Demons," or haven''t experienced Ten Drum''s《Magic Night Festival 1》yet, this time-spanning "century-old ruins" limited edition《Magic Night Festival 2》special performance will be a classic you can''t miss! ------------------------------------------------------------------ 在太陽落下、月亮升起之際—— 時空交錯的瞬間悄然開啟。 提起油燈， 步入百年歷史的糖廠遺址， 當工業文明的痕跡退場， 這島嶼真正的記憶將被喚醒。 廢墟不再只是廢墟， 而是轉化為連結天地、人神、東西方文明的—— 「神之島」魔法結界。 As the sun sets and the moon rises— the moment of spacetime intersection quietly unfolds. Pick up an oil lamp, step into the century-old sugar mill ruins, as traces of industrial civilization fade, the island''s true memories will awaken. The ruins are no longer mere ruins, but transform into a magical barrier of the "Island of the Gods," connecting heaven and earth, humans and deities, Eastern and Western civilizations. 而《魔法夜祭2－神之島》， 不再只是召喚。 當鼓聲被聽見， 島嶼，便現身。 神之島不是傳說， 而是我們腳下的土地： 山的脈動、海的呼吸、風的方向， 與人群聚集時，同時跳動的心。 以台灣為靈魂， 以百年糖廠為身體， 透過鼓聲， 讓這座島嶼再次說話。 "Magic Night Festival 2 - Island of the Gods" is no longer just a summoning. When the drumbeats are heard, the island reveals itself. The Island of the Gods is not a legend, but the land beneath our feet: the pulse of mountains, the breath of the sea, the direction of the wind, and the hearts beating together when people gather. With Taiwan as its soul, the century-old sugar mill as its body, through the drumbeats, this island speaks once again. 東方魔法 × 西方魔法 交會於島嶼之上 其實，「魔法」從來不是單一文化的專利。 在西方， 魔法是巫術、咒語與煉金術， 是人類試圖理解宇宙、挑戰命運的力量。 在東方， 魔法化為道術、符咒、法器與臉譜， 是一種順應天地、與自然共生的智慧。 《魔法夜祭2.0－神之島》， 正是這兩種魔法文明交會之地。 Eastern Magic × Western Magic Converging upon the island In truth, "magic" has never been the exclusive domain of a single culture. In the West, magic manifests as witchcraft, spells, and alchemy— humanity''s attempt to comprehend the universe and challenge fate. In the East, magic transforms into Taoist arts, talismans, ritual objects, and facial masks— a wisdom that harmonizes with heaven and earth, coexisting with nature. "Magic Night Festival 2.0 - Island of the Gods" is precisely where these two magical civilizations intersect. 官將首的臉譜成為守護島嶼的象徵， 鼓聲化為跨越語言的咒語， 舞蹈則是通往神域的身體語言。 The Guanjangshou mask becomes the symbol guarding the island, drumbeats transform into spells transcending language, and dance serves as the physical language leading to the divine realm. ▍跨界展演 × 環境劇場 × 魔法饗宴 ▍ | Cross-Boundary Performance × Environmental Theater × Magic Feast 【夜間限定・沉浸式經典之作】 延續2023年《魔法夜祭》的感動與口碑， 全面升級為2.0版本。 十鼓擊樂團攜手 滯留島舞蹈劇場、 少林長拳門－力行武術總會， 融合擊樂、舞蹈、武術、馬戲、人聲與空間設計， 打造一場只存在於夜晚、 只屬於百年糖廠的島嶼儀式。 Continuing the rave reviews and acclaim of 2023''s《Magic Night Festival》, fully upgraded to the 2.0 version. Ten Drum Percussion Group collaborates with Lagoon Island Dance Theater and Shaolin Changquan Sect - Lixing Wushu General Association, blending percussion, dance, martial arts, circus, vocals, and spatial design to create an island ritual that exists only at night, belonging exclusively to the century-old sugar mill. ----------------------------------------- ▌活動日期.地點 