he sea, the direction of the wind, and the hearts beating together when people gather. With Taiwan as its soul, the century-old sugar mill as its body, through the drumbeats, this island speaks once again. 東方魔法 × 西方魔法 交會於島嶼之上 其實，「魔法」從來不是單一文化的專利。 在西方， 魔法是巫術、咒語與煉金術， 是人類試圖理解宇宙、挑戰命運的力量。 在東方， 魔法化為道術、符咒、法器與臉譜， 是一種順應天地、與自然共生的智慧。 《魔法夜祭2.0－神之島》， 正是這兩種魔法文明交會之地。 Eastern Magic × Western Magic Converging upon the island In truth, "magic" has never been the exclusive domain of a single culture. In the West, magic manifests as witchcraft, spells, and alchemy— humanity''s attempt to comprehend the universe and challenge fate. In the East, magic transforms into Taoist arts, talismans, ritual objects, and facial masks— a wisdom that harmonizes with heaven and earth, coexisting with nature. "Magic Night Festival 2.0 - Island of the Gods" is precisely where these two magical civilizations intersect. 官將首的臉譜成為守護島嶼的象徵， 鼓聲化為跨越語言的咒語， 舞蹈則是通往神域的身體語言。 The Guanjangshou mask becomes the symbol guarding the island, drumbeats transform into spells transcending language, and dance serves as the physical language leading to the divine realm. ▍跨界展演 × 環境劇場 × 魔法饗宴 ▍ | Cross-Boundary Performance × Environmental Theater × Magic Feast 【夜間限定・沉浸式經典之作】 延續2023年《魔法夜祭》的感動與口碑， 全面升級為2.0版本。 十鼓擊樂團攜手 滯留島舞蹈劇場、 少林長拳門－力行武術總會， 融合擊樂、舞蹈、武術、馬戲、人聲與空間設計， 打造一場只存在於夜晚、 只屬於百年糖廠的島嶼儀式。 Continuing the rave reviews and acclaim of 2023''s《Magic Night Festival》, fully upgraded to the 2.0 version. Ten Drum Percussion Group collaborates with Lagoon Island Dance Theater and Shaolin Changquan Sect - Lixing Wushu General Association, blending percussion, dance, martial arts, circus, vocals, and spatial design to create an island ritual that exists only at night, belonging exclusively to the century-old sugar mill. ----------------------------------------- ▌活動日期.地點 Event Date & Location ▌ 加開場07/11 (六) 十鼓文創園區 (台南市仁德區文華路二段326號-十鼓文創園區-第二停車場) 開放入園時間18:30 JULY 11, 2026 (Saturday) Ten Drum Creative Park (No. 326, Section 2, Wenhua Road, Rende Dis