INSERT INTO "concert_crawl_candidate" ("id","source","source_id","source_kind","title","url","event_at","venue","city","organizer","extracted_text","raw_excerpt","status","confidence","ai_summary","error_message","crawled_at","reviewed_at","created_at","updated_at","evidence_json","source_payload_json","content_hash","parser_version") VALUES(888,'opentix','opentix:event-2047621979487760385','ticket_platform','玉山文教基金會輕鬆自在場 2026兩廳院夏日爵士童樂會《節奏千層麵》','https://www.opentix.life/event/2047621979487760385','2026-08-07T11:30:00.000Z','國家兩廳院演奏廳','臺北','主辦： 國家表演藝術中心國家兩廳院 (02)3393-9888','category: 音樂 event_at: 2026-08-07T11:30:00.000Z event_end_at: 2026-08-09T07:35:00.000Z cities: 臺北 首頁 藝術節及活動 旗艦館 公告 服務據點 協助中心 搜尋 OPENTIX 玉山文教基金會輕鬆自在場 2026兩廳院夏日爵士童樂會《節奏千層麵》 Jazz with Kids: Arturo O''Farrill''s Mambo Lasagna 類別： 音樂 分級：建議年齡 6歲以上 時間：2026/8/7 (五) - 2026/8/9 (日) 主辦： 國家表演藝術中心國家兩廳院 (02)3393-9888 收藏 旗艦館 2026兩廳院夏日爵士 親子音樂會 阿圖羅．奧法里爾 魏廣晧 購票資訊節目介紹折扣方案重要須知 購票資訊 選擇場館 國家兩廳院演奏廳 場館地址：臺北市中正區中山南路21-1號 地圖 選擇場次 2026/8/7 (五) 19:30 國家兩廳院演奏廳 提供電子票 剩：198 ／ 票價： 800 電腦配位 自行選位 2026/8/8 (六) 14:30 國家兩廳院演奏廳 提供電子票 剩：143 ／ 票價： 800 電腦配位 自行選位 2026/8/8 (六) 19:30 國家兩廳院演奏廳 提供電子票 剩：246 ／ 票價： 800 電腦配位 自行選位 2026/8/9 (日) 14:30 國家兩廳院演奏廳 提供電子票 剩：118 ／ 票價： 800 電腦配位 自行選位 節目介紹 音樂層層疊，節奏變美味！ 跟著葛萊美大師阿圖羅．奧法里爾現場品嚐爵士饗宴 Layering the Beats, Savoring the Sound! Experience a Live Jazz Feast with Grammy Master Arturo O''Farrill 《節奏千層麵》由葛萊美獎得主阿圖羅．奧法里爾專為親子觀眾打造，攜手其子鼓手柴克．奧法里爾與低音提琴巴姆．羅德里格茲呈現，並邀請臺灣爵士名家魏廣晧擔任主持與共同演出。以非洲拉丁為起點，透過食材比喻節奏層次，在多段互動環節引導觀眾參與，體驗音樂在層層堆疊中產生的律動與變化。 本節目為「輕鬆自在場」，歡迎每位觀眾以最放鬆、舒適的狀態欣賞表演。《節奏千層麵》不介意你隨音樂自由搖擺、發出歡呼聲，或讓孩子在座位上跟著節奏跳動。請用自己最喜歡的方式，與我們一起品味這道充滿文化底蘊的音樂料理！ Created specifically for families by Grammy Award winner Arturo O''Farrill, Mambo Lasagna features the maestro himself alongside his son, drummer Zack O''Farrill, bassist Bam Rodríguez, and celebrated Taiwanese jazz artist Stacey Wei, who joins as both performer and host. Rooted in the rich traditions of Afro-Latin jazz, the program likens musical rhythms to the layering of ingredients in a lasagna. Through a series of interactive moments, listeners are invited to participate, discovering how music evolves as each layer builds upon the last. This program is presented as a Relaxed Performance, meaning we welcome every guest to enjoy the show in whatever way feels most natural and comfortable. In the world of Mambo Lasagna, it is perfectly fine to sway to the music, cheer out loud, or let your children dance in their seats to the beat. Experience this vibrant “musical dish” in your own way—and savor a shared moment of joy, creativity, and cultural richness with us! 更多親子活動 ⇢⇢ 🎙️ 台塑石油《艾拉・費茲潔拉小姐，您好！》親子說故事 𝟳.𝟮𝟱(𝙎𝘼𝙏.)、𝟳.𝟮𝟲(𝙎𝙐𝙉.)、𝟴.𝟭(𝙎𝘼𝙏.)、𝟴.𝟮(𝙎𝙐𝙉.) 𝟭𝟬:𝟬𝟬-𝟭𝟬:𝟱𝟬、𝟭𝟭:𝟯𝟬-𝟭𝟮:𝟮𝟬 表演藝術圖書館 演出團隊 Credits 鋼琴 Piano｜阿圖羅．奧法里爾 Arturo O''Farrill 出生於墨西哥，被譽為「當代最偉大的鋼琴家之一」。身為六屆葛萊美獎得主，他完美橋接拉丁律動與現代爵士。2002年創立「非洲拉丁爵士管弦樂團」（ALJO），並成立非營利組織 Belongó 致力推廣文化與社群賦權。他不僅是活躍全球的作曲家，亦是在紐約任教的熱情教育家，2024年作品《Mundoagua》更被評為當代傑作。 Born in Mexico City and raised in New York, Arturo O''Farrill is hailed by DownBeat as "one of our greatest living pianists." A six-time GRAMMY® winner, he masterfully bridges the gap between traditional Latin rhythms and modern jazz. In 2002, he founded the Afro Latin Jazz Orchestra (ALJO) and later established the non-profit organization Belongó to advance Afro Latin jazz and community empowerment. Beyond being a world-renowned composer, he is a passionate educator in New York, and his 2024 release Mundoagua has been acclaimed as a contemporary masterwork. 低音提琴 Double Bass｜巴姆．羅德里格茲 Bam Rodríguez 葛萊美獎貝斯手、作曲家、影像創作者及社會活動家。現任阿圖羅．奧法里爾「非洲拉丁爵士管弦樂團」貝斯手，曾與 Chucho Valdés 等大師合作，足跡遍及卡內基廳與 Blue Note。他創立了免費音樂教育計畫「We Are Starting a School」，媒合紐約藝術家為全球弱勢學生授課；其執導的音樂錄影帶《forward》亦曾獲 FFH 影展最佳音樂錄影帶獎。 Bam Rodríguez is a GRAMMY® award-winning bassist, composer, filmmaker, and social activist. Currently the bassist for Arturo O''Farrill''s Afro Latin Jazz Orchestra, he has performed with legends such as Chucho Valdés and graced prestigious stages including Carnegie Hall and the Blue Note. He is the founder of the free educational program "We Are Starting a School," which connects New York City artists with disadvantaged students worldwide. Additionally, his music video Forward was awarded Best Music Video at the FFH Film Festival. 爵士鼓 Drums｜柴克．奧法里爾 Zack O''Farrill 來自布魯克林的鼓手、打擊樂家與教育家。出身音樂世家，不僅參與父親阿圖羅多張葛萊美獎獲獎專輯演出，更活躍於 Stranger Days 等樂團並巡演全球。其音樂風格不受框架限制，涵蓋非裔古巴大樂團、嘻哈、自由爵士等 。柴克擁有曼哈頓音樂學院碩士學位，長期致力教育工作，現任 Fat Afro Latin Jazz Cats 青年大樂團總監，為紐約優秀學生提供免費音樂指導。 A Brooklyn-based drummer, percussionist, and educator, Zack O''Farrill was born into a distinguished musical lineage. He has performed on several of his father Arturo''s GRAMMY®-winning albums and tours globally with ensembles such as Stranger Days. His versatile style defies genre, spanning Afro-Cuban big band, hip-hop, and free jazz. Holding a Master’s degree from the Manhattan School of Music, Zack is a dedicated educator currently serving as the director of the Fat Afro Latin Jazz Cats youth big band, providing free instruction to talented students in New York. 舞臺合作夥伴暨小號 Collaborating Artist & Trumpet｜魏廣晧 Stacey Wei 國立東華大學音樂學系主任，紐約市立大學爵士小號演奏碩士，師承 Michael Philip Mossman 等名家。曾與 Jimmy Cobb 等國際大師合作，亦跨足流行樂壇參與張惠妹、王力宏錄音及《老狐狸》電影配樂。專輯《43》曾入圍金曲獎，參與製作之兒童音樂節目亦獲金鐘入圍肯定。 Stacey Wei is the Chair of the Department of Music at National Dong Hwa University and holds a Master’s degree in Jazz Trumpet from the City University of New York, where he studied under masters like Michael Philip Mossman. He has collaborated with international legends such as Jimmy Cobb and has contributed to recordings for pop icons like A-Mei and Wang Leehom, as well as the soundtrack for the film Old Fox. His solo album 43 was nominated for a Golden Melody Award, and his work on the children''s music program Rooftop Music Party earned a Golden Bell Award nomination. 輕鬆自在場冠名贊助 特別感謝 折扣方案 文化禮金方案：2026.6.1 (MON.) 12:00 啟售，於OPENTIX網站或APP全額使用文化幣支付。 ✔ 青年席位專屬優惠：席次有限，售完為止。 ✔ 青年席位五折自由座：享有 5 折優惠；席次有限，售完為止。 * 持青年席位票券者，請憑證件（身分證或健保卡）入場，如無法出示相符證件之觀眾，節目當天現場不開放入場、