團同台演出。 從倫敦皇家亞伯特音樂廳到柏林音樂廳，馬丁納斯已是全球公認的手風琴巨星，他撐起風箱，在古典、流行與民族音樂的交界處，精準勾勒自我風格，更被《獨立報》盛讚為「憑一己之力重新定義手風琴的關鍵人物」。本次演出，將攜手 Mikroorkéstra 室內樂團，在韋瓦第經典的《四季》樂章間，巧妙穿插〈冬之歌〉與〈黎明破曉〉等原創作品，宛如自然的深刻獨白，帶領聽眾探索四季與林間。 Martynas LEVICKIS and Mikroorkéstra reimagine VIVALDI''sThe Four Seasons; through the versatile voice of the accordion, these iconic melodies are no longer mere descriptions of nature, but a sensory dialogue brimming with vitality. LEVICKIS artfully interlaces original works such as "Winter Song" and "The Dawn is Breaking"—profound monologues that echo the legendary seasons. Amidst the sparks of old and new, he leads the audience into a forest of sound, delivering a sensory feast that transcends the boundaries of time. 📢 周邊活動 ►《風箱間的四季》蔡偉靖手風琴體驗課 https://npacwwy.tw/en01d3MFv 曲目 Program 馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯：〈冬之歌〉 Martynas LEVICKIS: "Leliumoj" 韋瓦第：E大調第一號小提琴協奏曲〈春〉，選自《四季》，Op.8, RV 269 （由馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯改編給手風琴、弦樂與大鍵琴） A. VIVALDI: Concerto No. 1 in E Major, Op. 8, RV 269, "Spring" (arranged for accordion, strings, and harpsichord by Martynas LEVICKIS) 馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯：〈路旁低垂的菩提樹〉 Martynas LEVICKIS: "Palinko liepa šalia kelio" (A linden by the roadside bowed) 韋瓦第：g小調第二號小提琴協奏曲〈夏〉，選自《四季》，Op.8, RV 315 （由馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯改編給手風琴、弦樂與大鍵琴） A. VIVALDI: Concerto No. 2 in g minor, Op. 8, RV 315, "Summer" (arranged for accordion, strings, and harpsichord by Martynas LEVICKIS) 馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯：〈黎明破曉〉 Martynas LEVICKIS: "Beauštanti aušrelė" (The Dawn is Breaking) 韋瓦第：F大調第二號小提琴協奏曲〈秋〉，選自《四季》，Op.8, RV 293（由馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯改編給手風琴、弦樂與大鍵琴） A. VIVALDI: Concerto No. 3 in F Major, Op. 8, RV 293, "Autumn" (arranged for accordion, strings, and harpsichord by Martynas LEVICKIS) 馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯：〈青翠的街道〉 Martynas LEVICKIS: "Rūta žalioj" (The verdant Rue) 韋瓦第：f小調第二號小提琴協奏曲〈冬〉，選自《四季》，Op.8, RV 297 （由馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯改編給手風琴、弦樂與大鍵琴） A. VIVALDI: Concerto No. 4 in f minor, Op. 8, RV 297, "Winter" (arranged for accordion, strings, and harpsichord by Martynas LEVICKIS) 演出人員名單 手風琴：馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯／Mikroorkéstra室內樂團 Accordion: Martynas LEVICKIS / Mikroorkéstra 演出團隊介紹 手風琴｜馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯 馬丁納斯・萊維茨基斯喜歡稱他的樂器為「魔法百寶箱」，而這並非只是徒有其名，當這位立陶宛手風琴家踏上舞台，他便以精湛絕倫的技巧、細膩的音樂素養以及無邊的想像力，幻化出令人著迷的聲音風景。 他曾被《獨立報》譽為才華橫溢、憑一己之力重新定義了手風琴。時至今日，萊維茨基斯已成為當代古典樂壇中最令人振奮、最具變革精神的力量之一。 萊維茨基斯的音樂旅程並非始於音樂廳，而是源自立陶宛森林地區。年僅三歲時，他便拿著一把玩具手風琴，開始模仿鳥鳴與樹葉的沙沙聲——這份禮物其實是環境所迫下的選擇，因為當時他的家庭負擔不起一架鋼琴。然而，這個看似折衷的起點，卻意外成為他非凡生涯的基石。 Accordion｜Martynas LEVICKIS Martynas LEVICKIS likes to call his instrument a "magical box of tricks" – and indeed, when the Lithuanian accordionist steps onto the stage, he conjures mesmerising soundscapes with dazzling virtuosity, refined musicality, and boundless imagination. Hailed by The Independent as "the amazingly talented Martynas LEVICKIS, the man who is single-handedly reinventing the accordion", he stands as one of the most exciting and transformative forces in classical music today. LEVICKIS''s musical journey began not in a concert hall, but deep in the Lithuanian woods. At just three years old, he began imitating birdsong and the rustling of leaves on a toy accordion – a gift born of necessity, when his fami','pending',0.45,'','','2026-06-23T02:03:50.892Z',NULL,'2026-06-23T02:03:58.255Z','2026-06-23T02:03:58.216Z','[]','{}','','legacy');
